{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126184325287-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126212550\"/><p>消防到場把火救熄。（陳嘉順攝）</p><p>今午(26日)5時10分，旺角登打士街89-91號翠園大樓，一名姓劉(55歲)男工人在棚架上，使用火槍進行喉管工程。期間，懷疑火舌焫着棚架圍網引起火警，途人見狀報案。</p><p>消防接報趕至開喉將火救熄，但男工燒傷手及小腿，需要送往廣華醫院治療。事件中約10人自行疏散，案件列作「火警」及「有人意外受傷」處理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:03:54.359097+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":174,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T10:43:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T15:57:19.358011+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:57:17.171536+00:00","content_hash":"a7ecc1870afc5205b9813b71394aedd934fbeb41418f5b309419a8ae6bbb97f3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}